  "title": "Butternut Farro Salad with Blood Orange Vinaigrette",
  "description": "This nutty farro salad recipe is loaded with roasted butternut squash, cranberries, and toasted pecans and tossed with a tangy blood orange vinaigrette.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
